On 30 Sep 2005 12:09:04 -0700, camelma@gmail.com wrote:

> I upgraded via full installation a v5.1 box to v5.1B. my question is,
> will the OSF-BASE paks continue to work on the new system?
> 
> i have made a backup of the old system and lmf list full result. then i
> try to run 'lmfsetup' and enter the info i got from "lmf list full", i
> couldn't find the checksum and thus couldn't complete the licence
> registration.
> 
> what do i do now ?
> 
lmf list isn't enough, you need lmf issue to generate a copy of a license
you can use elsewhere.
If you have a backup of the system then recover the /var/adm/lmf directory
and you should be set, if you don't then contact HP with details of your
right to a license and they should be able to issue you a duplicate copy.
Adam


